  "explanation_short": "KNN achieved the best performance with an R² of 0.83014 and an MSE of 0.011901 when using 9 features (VFA -> Butyrate -> Acetate -> VSS -> Propionate -> Ethanol -> COD-O -> pH -> ORP_Low). Overall, KNN is the best model, outperforming RF, XGBoost, SVM, and DT.",
